OL,3,AHarvey Weinstein sentenced to 15 years
OL,4,Ain prison for sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeinstein has already spent several
OL,7,Fyears jailed in New York, where he has
OL,8,Ffaced three trials over rape and abuse
OL,9,Fallegations. He was convicted in a
OL,10,Fseperate sex-crime case in Los Angeles.
